      <h2 class="display">A different <em>way of listening.</em></h2>
      <div class="bio">
        <p>I'm an animal communicator and a channeler.</p>
        <p><strong>With animals,</strong> information comes through as images, feelings, words and small details, and I pass along exactly what I receive. Before a reading, I ask for only three things: a photo, your animal's name and their species. I leave out their history, symptoms and your own theories on purpose, so what comes through is theirs, not mine.</p>
        <p><strong>With people,</strong> I tap into your higher self and your guides, as well as my own. Come with your questions ready, and I'll bring through the answers you're seeking, along with anything that needs to come through or be addressed for your highest good. Sometimes I work in trance, and sometimes I stay present and share what I'm shown as it arrives. Either way, I don't polish it into what you might hope to hear. I give it to you as it comes.</p>
        <p>I trained through The Pet Psychic Academy, and I share my home with animals of my own, including a Doberman.</p>
      </div>
